  "question": {
    "text": "A person standing at the foot of a tower walks a distance of&nbsp;<math><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> meters from the tower and observes that the angle of elevation of the top of the tower is <math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> He then walks a distance <math><mn>4</mn></math> meters perpendicular to the previous direction and observes the angle of elevation to be <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow></mrow></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "c74eT",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "G2KYa",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "RGwBG",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "VASDe",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> be the foot of the tower <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/028073cf-e478-4ace-b308-fadf7892f074.png\" style=\"width:1.86042in;height:2.62708in\" /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> In <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>,</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br />and in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math><br />Thus, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
